          #PrincipalBundlesAsJudgements.num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              %strong (principal infinity-bundles as judgements)
            %p
              Specifically if
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
