            %p
              Moreover, the existence of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ♯
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \sharp
              means that the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mapping+stacks"} mapping stacks
              into these coefficients have
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+concretification"} differential concretification
              to
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+stacks"} moduli stacks
              of differential cocycles.
          %p
            The first statement is the key insight in (
            %a{:href => "#BunkeNikolausVoelkl13"}> Bunke-Nikolaus-Völkl 13
            ). For more amplification of this point see at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Differential+cohomology+is+Cohesive+homotopy+theory"} Differential cohomology is Cohesive homotopy theory
          %p Here the moments appearing in the hexagon have the following interpretation.
          .maruku-equation
