          %h5#elastic_substance Elastic substance
          %h6#tal Étalé
          %p Continuing the process, we posit a further opposition of moments lifting the previous ones.
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
