          %p
            More in detail, we may ask just
            %em how
            small these small paths are. Hence we demand more generally an infinite tower
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ʃ
