            %h6#definition_8 Definition
            %p
              Denote the first and second
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fiber"} homotopy fiber
              of the comparison map
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
