            locally cohesively, but here in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+differential+geometry"} higher differential geometry
            this
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/property"} property
            becomes genuine
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure"} structure
            and hence we need to demand it. There is an axiomatic way to say this (see
            %a{:href => "#dcct"} dcct
            for details) and if this is imposed then we say that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi L
                    %mi WZW
                    %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{L}_{WZW}^X
            is a
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/definite+globalization+of+WZW+term"} definite globalization
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
