              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stabilizer+%E2%88%9E-group"} stabilizer ∞-group
              of the restriction of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
