            %em presuppose
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/first+order+logic"} first order logic
            as accepted
            %em a priori
            (i.e. not itself formalized in another system, for one needs to start somewhere), and then formulate all
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/theory"} theory
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set+theory"} set theory
          %p
            But other such starting points are possible. For instance taking instead
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+theory"} type theory
            or
