          %p
            Indeed, later in
            %a{:href => "#174"} §174
            it says:
          %blockquote
            %p there is nothing which is not an intermediate state between being and nothing.
          %p
            Also,
            %a{:href => "#SomethingAndAnOther"} below
            it says
          %blockquote
            %p#222 §222 Being and nothing in their unity, which is determinate being
          %p
            which points to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aufhebung"} Aufhebung
            of this duality via the
