            which characterizes a higher
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/level+of+a+topos"} level of a topos
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
