          %blockquote
            %p The nameless nonbeing is the origin of universe;
            %p The named being is the mother of all observed things.
            %p Within nonbeing, we enjoy the mystery of the universe.
            %p Among being, we observe the richness of the world.
            %p Nonbeing and being are two aspects of the same mystery.
            %p From nonbeing to being and from being to nonbeing is the gateway to all understanding.
          %h4#second_chapter_dasein__determinate_being Second chapter. Dasein / Determinate Being
