                  }
          %blockquote
            %p
              %a{:href => "#EL99"} EL§99
              Die Quantität ist das reine Sein, an dem die Bestimmtheit nicht mehr als eins mit dem Sein selbst, sondern als aufgehoben oder gleichgültig gesetzt ist.
            %p EL§99 Quantity is pure Being, where the mode or character is no longer taken as one with the being itself, but explicitly put as superseded or indifferent.
          %h6#on_attraction__cohesion On attraction / cohesion
          %blockquote
            %p#395 §395 Attraction is in this way the moment of continuity in quantity.
          %p
            attraction is what holds stuff together, hence this is the idea of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesion"} cohesion
          %p
            if
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            has continuity then the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/shape+modality"} shape modality
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ʃ
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} &amp;#643; X
            is the result of letting things collapse under their cohesion/attraction
          %h6#OnDiscretenessAndRepulsion On discreteness and repulsion
          %blockquote
            %p §397 In continuity, therefore, magnitude immediately possesses the moment of discreteness — repulsion, as now a moment in quantity.
          %p
            continuous object
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            possesses moment of
            = succeed "=" do
