            %a{:href => "function+monad#TorontoMcCarthy10b"} Toronto-McCarthy 10a, 2.2
            the authors call the monad
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
