              ,
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ulrich+Majer"} Ulrich Majer
              with Arne Schirrmacher, Heinz-Jürgen Schmidt (eds.):
              = succeed "," do
                %em David Hilbert’s Lectures on the foundations of physics 1915-1927 — Relativity, Quantum Theory and Epistemology
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/b12915"} doi:10.1007/b12915
          %p
            Comments on the similarity of Hegel’s physics to aspects of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+relativity"} general relativity
            are in
